  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation of Water Conservation Infrastructure Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will rehabilitate and extend water conservation infrastructure in the basin of Nakanb&#xe9;, Burkina Faso. Project components include repairs of six dams in Nakanb&#xe9; basin, and dredging of multiple basins to improve water quality and water retention capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
